{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf4c The fruit are falling again... and they\u2019re not alone.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Congratulations. You survived the fruitpocalypse. But now they\u2019re back. And this time\u2026 they brought friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fruit Hoop 2</strong> is the mind-meltingly ridiculous sequel to the indie classic <i>Fruit Hoop</i>. You once again take control of a hoop\u2014yes, just a hoop\u2014on an eternal mission to catch falling produce and dodge anything that wants you dead. But now, there are more fruits. More hazards. More bananas. So many bananas.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf4a <strong>How to Play</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Move your hoop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Catch the good stuff.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Avoid the bad stuff.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Repeat until your hands hurt or your brain melts.<br>(Or both.)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\uded0 <strong>Still Not Convinced?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u2019s like <i>Frogger</i> had a baby with a blender.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Minimal narrative, maximum vibes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Designed for that \u201cone more try\u201d loop that ruins sleep schedules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No microtransactions. Only macrofruit.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1477030?t=1752297947","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1477030?t=1752297947","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477030/5b707c10772c0121c73b4dbdcffbd80597c815e3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752297947","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477030/5b707c10772c0121c73b4dbdcffbd80597c815e3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752297947","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf4c The fruit are falling again... and they\u2019re not alone.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Congratulations. You survived the fruitpocalypse. But now they\u2019re back. And this time\u2026 they brought friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fruit Hoop 2</strong> is the mind-meltingly ridiculous sequel to the indie classic <i>Fruit Hoop</i>. You once again take control of a hoop\u2014yes, just a hoop\u2014on an eternal mission to catch falling produce and dodge anything that wants you dead. But now, there are more fruits. More hazards. More bananas. So many bananas.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf4a <strong>How to Play</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Move your hoop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Catch the good stuff.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Avoid the bad stuff.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Repeat until your hands hurt or your brain melts.<br>(Or both.)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\uded0 <strong>Still Not Convinced?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u2019s like <i>Frogger</i> had a baby with a blender.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Minimal narrative, maximum vibes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Designed for that \u201cone more try\u201d loop that ruins sleep schedules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No microtransactions. Only macrofruit.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Teeter Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477030/dfc66b19bdf962c431e7f3a207db84e503131d44/header.jpg?t=1752297947","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<st